@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - Utkeern</PageTitle>

<section class="about-hero">
    <div class="about-hero-content">
        <h1>About Utkeern</h1>
        <p>A personal journey preserving the legacy of Indian heritage</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-narrative grid-2">
            <div class="about-image">
                <img src="images/design-desk.jpeg" alt="Heritage preservation journey" />
            </div>
            <div class="about-text">
                <h2>Preserving Heritage, Sharing Knowledge</h2>
                <p>
                    Utkeern began as a personal quest to explore and document the rich tapestry of Indian heritage. 
                    The name itself derives from Sanskrit, meaning "preservation" or "engraving" — capturing the essence 
                    of our mission to document and preserve cultural knowledge.
                </p>
                <p>
                    What started as photography expeditions to heritage sites evolved into a comprehensive initiative 
                    focused on creating accessible, high-quality resources for students, researchers, and heritage enthusiasts. 
                    Every image, every article, every project reflects a commitment to honoring the craftsmanship and wisdom 
                    of our ancestors.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Today, Utkeern serves as a bridge between past and present — using modern technology to preserve traditions, 
                    making heritage education accessible to everyone, and fostering a deeper appreciation for the depth and 
                    beauty of Indian culture.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="heritage-divider"></div>

<section class="content alt">
    <div class="container-sm">
        <SectionHeader Title="Mission & Values" />

        <div class="grid-3">
            <ValueCard 
                Title="Preservation" 
                Description="Documenting and archiving heritage through high-quality visual and written content." />
            
            <ValueCard 
                Title="Education" 
                Description="Making heritage knowledge accessible to students and lifelong learners worldwide." />
            
            <ValueCard 
                Title="Respect" 
                Description="Honoring cultural traditions and proper attribution of creators and communities." />
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="heritage-divider"></div>

<section class="content">
    <div class="container-sm">
        <SectionHeader Title="The Creator" />

        <div class="creator-bio grid-2">
            <div class="bio-image">
                <img src="images/design-desk.jpeg" alt="Creator portrait" />
            </div>
            <div class="bio-content">
                <h3>Hello, I'm Nikita Ratore</h3>
                <p>
                    A designer, photographer, and heritage enthusiast passionate about exploring and sharing the depth of 
                    Indian culture. My work combines technical expertise with cultural curiosity, aiming to create meaningful 
                    resources that bridge ancient wisdom with modern learning.
                </p>
                <div class="bio-highlights">
                    <ul>
                        <li>Photography: Heritage documentation and architectural photography</li>
                        <li>Design: User experience design and visual storytelling</li>
                        <li>Research: Cultural history and heritage preservation methodologies</li>
                        <li>Education: Creating accessible learning resources</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="bio-cta">
                    <a href="mailto:contact@example.com" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content alt">
    <div class="container">
        <SectionHeader Title="Why This Matters" />

        <div class="impact-section">
            <div class="impact-item">
                <span class="impact-number">2000+</span>
                <h4>Heritage Images Archived</h4>
                <p>High-resolution documentation of cultural sites and artifacts</p>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-item">
                <span class="impact-number">50+</span>
                <h4>Research Articles</h4>
                <p>In-depth exploration of heritage and cultural themes</p>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-item">
                <span class="impact-number">10k+</span>
                <h4>Student Users</h4>
                <p>Learners using resources for academic and creative work</p>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-item">
                <span class="impact-number">Global</span>
                <h4>Community Reach</h4>
                <p>Connecting heritage enthusiasts worldwide</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

